{
  "_comment": "PROPOSED .claude/settings.json for agentic-software-delivery (project-shared, checked in, contains no secrets). These are deterministic permission rules evaluated BEFORE the auto-mode classifier. deny = hard block nobody can override; nothing here uses ask, because ask rules always prompt even when the task authorised the action, which would break the explicit end-to-end delivery workflow.",
